{"seq":2,"slug":"container-orchestration-platform","title":"容器编排平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/platform-toolchain/container-orchestration-platform","wordCount":840,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"容器编排平台\">容器编排平台</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>容器编排平台是现代平台工程的运行时基座。Kubernetes 已成为事实上的标准，但在大规模组织中，管理多个 Kubernetes 集群——跨环境（开发/预发/生产）、跨区域（多数据中心/多云）——带来了显著的复杂性。平台工程的目标是将这些复杂性封装在平台层，让开发者以业务语义而非 Kubernetes 原语来描述部署需求。</p>\n<p>多集群管理的核心挑战包括：配置一致性（如何确保所有集群的安全策略和网络配置一致）、跨集群服务发现（如何让不同集群的服务互相通信）以及运维效率（如何高效地在数十个集群上执行变更）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 控制平面&#10;        A[多集群管理器]&#10;        B[策略引擎]&#10;        C[GitOps 控制器]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 开发集群&#10;        D[dev-cluster]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 预发集群&#10;        E[staging-cluster]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 生产集群&#10;        F[prod-us-east]&#10;        G[prod-eu-west]&#10;        H[prod-ap-southeast]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; D&#10;    A --&gt; E&#10;    A --&gt; F&#10;    A --&gt; G&#10;    A --&gt; H&#10;    B --&gt; D&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    B --&gt; F&#10;    B --&gt; G&#10;    B --&gt; H&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    C --&gt; G&#10;    C --&gt; H\">graph TB\n    subgraph 控制平面\n        A[多集群管理器]\n        B[策略引擎]\n        C[GitOps 控制器]\n    end\n    subgraph 开发集群\n        D[dev-cluster]\n    end\n    subgraph 预发集群\n        E[staging-cluster]\n    end\n    subgraph 生产集群\n        F[prod-us-east]\n        G[prod-eu-west]\n        H[prod-ap-southeast]\n    end\n    A --&gt; D\n    A --&gt; E\n    A --&gt; F\n    A --&gt; G\n    A --&gt; H\n    B --&gt; D\n    B --&gt; E\n    B --&gt; F\n    B --&gt; G\n    B --&gt; H\n    C --&gt; D\n    C --&gt; E\n    C --&gt; F\n    C --&gt; G\n    C --&gt; H</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>单集群</th>\n<th>多集群手动管理</th>\n<th>平台化多集群</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>配置一致性</td>\n<td>无问题</td>\n<td>容易漂移</td>\n<td>策略引擎保障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨环境部署</td>\n<td>手动切换</td>\n<td>脚本自动化</td>\n<td>GitOps 统一管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障影响</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>部分隔离</td>\n<td>完全隔离 + 自动切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容量规划</td>\n<td>单集群扩展</td>\n<td>人工评估</td>\n<td>自动化调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维效率</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>线性增长</td>\n<td>平台统一操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"kubernetes-多集群管理\">Kubernetes 多集群管理</h2><p>多集群管理工具负责将统一的配置和策略分发到所有集群，确保一致性和合规性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MultiClusterArchitecture {&#10;  managementTools: {&#10;    argocd: {&#10;      pattern: &#39;Hub-and-Spoke（中心辐射）&#39;;&#10;      mechanism: &#39;中央 ArgoCD 管理所有集群的 GitOps&#39;;&#10;      scaling: &#39;App of Apps 模式管理大量应用&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;    fleet: {&#10;      pattern: &#39;Rancher Fleet&#39;;&#10;      mechanism: &#39;声明式多集群 GitOps&#39;;&#10;      feature: &#39;集群分组 + Bundle 分发&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;    karmada: {&#10;      pattern: &#39;联邦调度&#39;;&#10;      mechanism: &#39;统一 API 面，工作负载自动分发到成员集群&#39;;&#10;      feature: &#39;跨集群调度策略&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;  clusterProvisioning: {&#10;    tool: &#39;Cluster API (CAPI) / Crossplane&#39;;&#10;    workflow: &#39;声明集群规格 → 自动创建 → 自动注册到管理面&#39;;&#10;    standardization: [&#10;      &#39;统一 CNI（如 Cilium）&#39;,&#10;      &#39;统一 Ingress Controller（如 Nginx/Envoy）&#39;,&#10;      &#39;统一监控 Agent（OpenTelemetry）&#39;,&#10;      &#39;统一安全策略（OPA Gatekeeper）&#39;,&#10;    ];&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MultiClusterArchitecture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  managementTools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    argocd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      pattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Hub-and-Spoke（中心辐射）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      mechanism</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '中央 ArgoCD 管理所有集群的 GitOps'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      scaling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'App of Apps 模式管理大量应用'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    fleet</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      pattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Rancher Fleet'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      mechanism</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '声明式多集群 GitOps'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      feature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '集群分组 + Bundle 分发'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    karmada</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      pattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '联邦调度'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      mechanism</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '统一 API 面，工作负载自动分发到成员集群'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      feature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '跨集群调度策略'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  clusterProvisioning</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Cluster API (CAPI) / Crossplane'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    workflow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '声明集群规格 → 自动创建 → 自动注册到管理面'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    standardization</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '统一 CNI（如 Cilium）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '统一 Ingress Controller（如 Nginx/Envoy）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '统一监控 Agent（OpenTelemetry）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '统一安全策略（OPA Gatekeeper）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# ArgoCD ApplicationSet：多集群部署&#10;apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: ApplicationSet&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: order-service&#10;  namespace: argocd&#10;spec:&#10;  generators:&#10;    - clusters:&#10;        selector:&#10;          matchLabels:&#10;            environment: production&#10;  template:&#10;    metadata:&#10;      name: &#39;order-service-{{name}}&#39;&#10;    spec:&#10;      project: order-team&#10;      source:&#10;        repoURL: https://github.com/org/order-service&#10;        targetRevision: main&#10;        path: deploy/overlays/{{metadata.labels.region}}&#10;      destination:&#10;        server: &#39;{{server}}&#39;&#10;        namespace: order-service&#10;      syncPolicy:&#10;        automated:&#10;          prune: true&#10;          selfHeal: true&#10;        syncOptions:&#10;          - CreateNamespace=true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ArgoCD ApplicationSet：多集群部署</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argoproj.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ApplicationSet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">argocd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  generators</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">clusters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-service-{{name}}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      project</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        repoURL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://github.com/org/order-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        targetRevision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">deploy/overlays/{{metadata.labels.region}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        server</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{{server}}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      syncPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        automated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          prune</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          selfHeal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        syncOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CreateNamespace=true</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ArgoCD 的 ApplicationSet 是管理多集群部署的有效工具。通过集群标签选择器，一份配置可以自动分发到所有匹配的集群。结合 Kustomize 的 overlay 机制，可以在保持基础配置一致的同时，为不同区域定制特定参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命名空间策略与多租户\">命名空间策略与多租户</h2><p>Kubernetes 命名空间是平台多租户隔离的基本单元。每个团队或服务拥有独立的命名空间，配合 RBAC、网络策略和资源配额实现隔离。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface NamespaceStrategy {&#10;  namingConvention: {&#10;    pattern: &#39;{team}-{service}-{environment}&#39;;&#10;    examples: [&#39;order-team-order-service-dev&#39;, &#39;order-team-order-service-prod&#39;];&#10;  };&#10;  provisioning: {&#10;    trigger: &#39;新服务创建时自动创建命名空间&#39;;&#10;    includes: [&#10;      &#39;命名空间创建&#39;,&#10;      &#39;RBAC RoleBinding（团队成员读写、其他只读）&#39;,&#10;      &#39;NetworkPolicy（默认拒绝入站、允许同命名空间）&#39;,&#10;      &#39;ResourceQuota（CPU、内存、Pod 数量限制）&#39;,&#10;      &#39;LimitRange（单 Pod 资源上下限）&#39;,&#10;    ];&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NamespaceStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  namingConvention</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    pattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{team}-{service}-{environment}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    examples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-team-order-service-dev'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-team-order-service-prod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  provisioning</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    trigger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '新服务创建时自动创建命名空间'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    includes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '命名空间创建'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'RBAC RoleBinding（团队成员读写、其他只读）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'NetworkPolicy（默认拒绝入站、允许同命名空间）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'ResourceQuota（CPU、内存、Pod 数量限制）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      'LimitRange（单 Pod 资源上下限）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 命名空间标准化模板&#10;apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Namespace&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: order-service-prod&#10;  labels:&#10;    team: order-team&#10;    environment: production&#10;    cost-center: engineering&#10;---&#10;apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: ResourceQuota&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: standard-quota&#10;  namespace: order-service-prod&#10;spec:&#10;  hard:&#10;    requests.cpu: &#39;8&#39;&#10;    requests.memory: &#39;16Gi&#39;&#10;    limits.cpu: &#39;16&#39;&#10;    limits.memory: &#39;32Gi&#39;&#10;    pods: &#39;50&#39;&#10;    services: &#39;10&#39;&#10;    persistentvolumeclaims: &#39;5&#39;&#10;---&#10;apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: NetworkPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: default-deny-ingress&#10;  namespace: order-service-prod&#10;spec:&#10;  podSelector: {}&#10;  policyTypes:&#10;    - Ingress&#10;  ingress:&#10;    - from:&#10;        - namespaceSelector:&#10;            matchLabels:&#10;              team: order-team&#10;        - namespaceSelector:&#10;            matchLabels:&#10;              role: ingress-controller\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 命名空间标准化模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Namespace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service-prod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    team</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<s